      <h3>Domain-Driven German Language Learning Platform</h3>

      <p class="project-body">
        huhuGERMAN introduces authentic German documentary content (Y-Kollektiv, funk/ARD)
        from A1 level — directly challenging the field consensus that recommends delaying
        authentic materials until post-A2. The platform operationalizes the distinction
        between <em>global comprehension</em> (understanding general topics) and
        <em>selective comprehension</em> (recognizing specific structures).
      </p>

      <div class="adr-quote">
        "La IA ya no decide: obedece al dominio." — ADR núcleo, 2025
      </div>

      <p class="project-body">
        The critical architectural decision: the pedagogical domain (what has been taught,
        what is forbidden to correct, under what conditions) is formalized as typed Zod schemas
        and becomes the single source of truth. The AI does not decide what to correct.
        It executes the domain's rules. This eliminates inconsistent feedback, prompt engineering
        magic, and the silent technical debt that accumulates when grammar knowledge lives
        only in the teacher's head.
      </p>

